Z||000000||Dave85||09-23-1999||07:59 PM||||<BR>If you live in or around NW Arkansas I have put together a little road trip. We are meeting at the Clarion Inn in Fayetteville, AR on Oct. 3rd at 10 am. and will be going to Ozark, AR via Hwy 16, 23(Pig Trail).  Rumor has it that this road was built just for Fieros!!  There are about a dozen cars already planning the trip.  You can E-mail me if you want more info. BTW, I would recommend doing something like this wherever you live. I just made up a flyer and stop every Fiero I see. Great way to meet other Fiero owners! ||||reg||6
